            <ArticleTitle>Clinical pain management peri-operative scenarios.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>517-35; viii</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.cpm.2008.02.010</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reinforces the clinical points of emphasis that have been stressed throughout this issue in a case scenario format. Common situations dealt with by physicians are examined to highlight the underlying physiology of the specific complaints and treatment interventions. The goal of this article is to present an evidenced-based review of pain management interventions in a format that allows for reader incorporation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
